+Fields using `enum` can also use `ui:placeholder`. The value will be used as the text for the empty option in the select widget.
+
+```jsx
+const schema = {type: "string", enum: ["First", "Second"]};
+const uiSchema = {
+  "ui:placeholder": "Choose an option"
+};
+```
